<title>USA: Publicker Industries will keep Greenwald.</title>
<headline>Publicker Industries will keep Greenwald.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publicker Industries Inc said Tuesday it will not sell Greenwald Industries, a subsidiary that makes coin meter systems.</p>
<p>Publicker said a letter of intent to sell Greenwald has expired.</p>
</text>
